# Project Structure

## Stack

- Node.js v24.19.0 + pnpm
- NestJS v11 + TypeScript + TypeORM (PostgreSQL) + Swagger (OpenAPI 3.0)
- JWT + Passport
- Jest

## Module layout

```
src/
  modules/
    <module-name>/
      domain/
        entities/
          <entity-name>.entity.ts
        repositories/
          <repository-name>.repository.interface.ts

      application/
        use-cases/
          <use-case-name>/
            <use-case-name>.use-case.ts

      infrastructure/
        persistence/
          typeorm/
            <entity-name>.typeorm-entity.ts
          <repository-name>.repository.impl.ts
        http/
          dtos/
            request/
              <dto-name>.request.dto.ts
              <dto-name>.dto.ts        # sub-item / nested interface
            response/
              <dto-name>.response.dto.ts
              <dto-name>.dto.ts        # sub-item / nested interface
          <module-name>.controller.ts

      <module-name>.module.ts
```

## Layer responsibilities

| Layer | File | Responsibility |
|---|---|---|
| Domain entity | `domain/entities/*.entity.ts` | Pure class, no ORM decorators. Factory methods, state transitions, invariants, computed properties. |
| Repository interface | `domain/repositories/*.repository.interface.ts` | Defines the contract only. Exports the injection token constant. |
| Use case | `application/use-cases/**/*.use-case.ts` | All business logic. Decorated with `@Injectable()`. Injects the repository by token. |
| TypeORM entity | `infrastructure/persistence/typeorm/*.typeorm-entity.ts` | ORM decorators, table structure. Never imported by the domain. |
| Repository impl | `infrastructure/persistence/*.repository.impl.ts` | Implements the interface. Contains `toOrm` / `toDomain` mappers. |
| Request DTO | `infrastructure/http/dtos/request/*.request.dto.ts` | Validates input with class-validator. Fully documented with Swagger. |
| Response DTO | `infrastructure/http/dtos/response/*.response.dto.ts` | Shapes the output. Exposes a static `fromDomain` factory. Fully documented with Swagger. |
| Controller | `infrastructure/http/*.controller.ts` | HTTP only — calls the use case, returns `ApiResponseDto`. No logic. |
| Module | `<module-name>.module.ts` | Wires the DI graph: binds the token to the impl, registers use cases and the controller. |
